---
title: Maker Night — Things 4 Good
description: An evening for six at Things 4 Good Maker Night, hand-pouring four candles of your own. Your ticket is a one-of-a-kind Maker Night candle, a $250 donation at the fall sale. 100% to good.
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}

{# Off years (site.makerNight false): the page stays up but is unlinked and kept out of search. #}
{% block head %}{% if not site.makerNight %}<meta name="robots" content="noindex" />{% endif %}{% endblock %}

{% block navDate %}{{ site.makerNightDateShort }} &middot; 6 spots{% endblock %}
{% block navCta %}<a class="btn btn--primary nav-cta" href="#reserve">Get a ticket</a>{% endblock %}

{% block content %}

<!-- ============================ HERO ============================ -->
<section class="section section--ink hero" id="hero">
  <div class="hero-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy reveal">
      <a href="/" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.4em;color:var(--marigold);font-weight:700;font-size:.9rem;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:8px">&larr; Things 4 Good</a>
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ site.makerNightDate }} &middot; by reservation</p>
      <h1 style="margin-top:18px">Maker <span class="pine" style="color:var(--marigold)">Night.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">An intimate evening for six. Pour four Things 4 Good candles with your own hands from scents we&rsquo;ve curated. Your ticket is a one-of-a-kind Maker Night candle, sold only at the fall sale.</p>
      <div class="spots" role="img" aria-label="Six spots available">
        <span class="flames"><span class="flame"></span><span class="flame"></span><span class="flame"></span><span class="flame"></span><span class="flame"></span><span class="flame"></span></span>
        <span class="stxt">Only 6 spots</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="#reserve">How to get a ticket <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#evening">See the evening</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-note">$250 Maker Night candle at the sale, {{ site.saleDates | safe }} &middot; 100% to good</p>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-art reveal">
      <div class="tape" style="background:#1f1812;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.16)">
        <span class="hand" style="color:var(--marigold)">one of a kind&hellip;</span>
        <small style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.6)">YOUR MAKER NIGHT CANDLE</small>
      </div>
      <img class="ph" src="/images/maker-night.jpg" alt="A tray of lit wooden-wick candles glowing in the dark" style="object-fit:cover" />
      <div class="badge" style="background:var(--marigold);color:#2B2017" aria-hidden="true">
        <b>6</b><span>seats only</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========================= THE EVENING ========================= -->
<section class="section" id="evening">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">The evening</p>
      <h2 class="t">Make a night of it.</h2>
      <p class="lead">We provide everything &mdash; the wax, the wicks, the workspace, and the know-how. You bring the company and the creativity.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step reveal">
        <div class="num">1</div>
        <h3>Get your ticket</h3>
        <p>Buy a Maker Night candle at the fall sale &mdash; a one-of-a-kind scent and label, and only six of them. It&rsquo;s a $250 donation, and it&rsquo;s your seat.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step alt reveal">
        <div class="num">2</div>
        <h3>Choose your scents</h3>
        <p>On the night, sample and pick from a curated selection of scents we maintain just for Maker Night, mixing and matching across your four candles.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step reveal">
        <div class="num">3</div>
        <h3>Pour your four</h3>
        <p>Set the wooden wicks and hand-pour four of your very own Things 4 Good candles, with us guiding every step.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ====================== WHAT'S INCLUDED ====================== -->
<section class="section section--paper2" id="included">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Included with your $250 donation</p>
      <h2 class="t">What you take home.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="gifts">
      <div class="gift reveal">
        <div class="big">4</div>
        <h3>Candles you poured</h3>
        <p>Four full-size Things 4 Good wooden-wick candles, made by your own hands in the scents you choose.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="gift alt reveal">
        <div class="big">1</div>
        <h3>One-of-a-kind candle</h3>
        <p>The Maker Night candle you buy at the sale &mdash; a unique scent and label made only for Maker Night. It&rsquo;s your ticket in.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="gift reveal">
        <div class="big">100%</div>
        <h3>Goes to good</h3>
        <p>Like everything we do, the full $250 is a donation. Every dollar goes to the causes our family supports.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========================= THE DETAILS ========================= -->
<section class="section" id="details">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">The details</p>
      <h2 class="t">Good to know.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="sale-grid">
      <div class="when-card reveal">
        <div class="glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p class="eyebrow">When</p>
        <div style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.6rem);line-height:1.05;margin:14px 0 6px;position:relative;z-index:1">{{ site.makerNightDate | replace(", ", ",<br />", 1) | safe }}</div>
        <p class="when-note">An evening for six guests. We&rsquo;ll confirm the time and the address with each guest directly.</p>
        <a class="btn btn--primary" style="margin-top:22px" href="#reserve">How to get a ticket <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></a>
      </div>

      <div class="info-card reveal">
        <div class="info-row">
          <div class="k">Donation</div>
          <div class="v"><b>$250</b> per guest, given at the fall sale when you buy your Maker Night candle. That candle is your ticket.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-row">
          <div class="k">Spots</div>
          <div class="v"><b>Six only.</b> We keep the night small and hands-on, so everyone gets real time at the pouring station.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-row">
          <div class="k">Where</div>
          <div class="v">Hosted by the Thingelstad family in Minneapolis. Address shared with confirmed guests.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-row">
          <div class="k">You leave with</div>
          <div class="v">Four candles you poured, plus the one-of-a-kind Maker Night candle that got you in.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========================= RESERVE ========================= -->
<section class="section section--pine subscribe" id="reserve">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center">Tickets</p>
    <h2 class="t" style="max-width:20ch;margin-inline:auto">Six seats. Want one of them?</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="margin:18px auto 0;text-align:center">Buy a Maker Night candle at the Things 4 Good sale, {{ site.saleDates | safe }}. It&rsquo;s a $250 donation and your ticket to Maker Night on {{ site.makerNightDate }}. There are only six, first come, first served.</p>
    <div class="sub-form" style="max-width:none">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/#sale">See the sale details</a>
    </div>
    <p class="sub-note">Questions? Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" style="color:#fff;font-weight:600">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

{% endblock %}
